  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [postcss-loader](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader) from `v2.0.6` to `v2.0.10`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v2.0.7`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/releases/v2.0.7)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* sanitizing `from` and `to` options (`postcss.config.js`) ([#&#8203;260](`https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/260`)) ([753dea7](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/753dea7))\n* **index:** runaway promise ([#&#8203;269](`https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/269`)) ([8df20ce](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/8df20ce))\n\n---\n\n### [`v2.0.8`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/releases/v2.0.8)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **lib/options:** handle `{Object}` return (`options.plugins`) ([#&#8203;301](`https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/301`)) ([df010a7](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/df010a7))\n* **schema:** allow to pass an `{Object}` (`options.syntax/options.stringifier`) ([#&#8203;300](`https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/300`)) ([58e9996](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/58e9996))\n\n---\n\n### [`v2.0.9`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/releases/v2.0.9)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **index:** filter `ident` (`options.ident`) ([#&#8203;315](`https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/315`)) ([3e1c7fa](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/3e1c7fa))\n\n---\n\n### [`v2.0.10`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/releases/v2.0.10)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **index:** copy loader `options` before modifying ([#&#8203;326](`https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/326`)) ([61ff03c](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/61ff03c))\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v2.0.7\n-   [`753dea7`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/753dea708e4ccda5999f27eaaedc9a3c0ee27541) fix: sanitizing `from` and `to` options (`postcss.config.js`) (#&#8203;260)\n-   [`271ab9a`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/271ab9a86799a97e3b230815e8365728b4072615) chore(package): update `webpack v2.6.1...3.0.0` (`devDependencies`) (#&#8203;270)\n-   [`f512a20`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/f512a209f9bb0614f5676e7a9af989381acb18ac) docs(README): add missing comma in example (#&#8203;295)\n-   [`403f5e2`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/403f5e21955314b0183a74306611408796da13c7) fix(index): runaway promise (#&#8203;269)\n-   [`44f01bb`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/44f01bbf57e674508ac3e49271574fe410e299fe) docs(README): remove `autoprefixer` from example (#&#8203;289)\n-   [`8df20ce`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/8df20ce0c47946c27a320cda5be68cb3f03f4183) fix(index): runaway promise (#&#8203;269)\n-   [`813bcbd`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/813bcbd2ae3fe0a1393fafd656969885e3aff6da) docs(README): readd `ident: postcss` to examples (`options.ident`) (#&#8203;297)\n-   [`081a638`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/081a638539d026f06ac5d5a12d9041faf27de992) docs(README): add loader description (#&#8203;298)\n-   [`0ec251d`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/0ec251d76a996f17bb788488582c9af6b981598c) chore(.github): add `CODEOWNERS` for review\n-   [`cd7cc1f`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/cd7cc1f39d21051e3900f09b761285cc40d0afa2) chore(.github): add `ISSUE_TEMPLATE`\n-   [`305840c`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/305840ca2083635f614a942a7d3af84a1d8f3636) chore(.github): add `PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE`\n-   [`aaf1672`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/aaf1672a921ed6a9c3e4f7fad0477a63f1577e56) chore(package): update `jest` v20.0.0...21.0.0\n-   [`e066f34`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/e066f34061a8656e7401a68fd2b5f4a8e9cc8612) test: refactor (#&#8203;299)\n-   [`30d8d51`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/30d8d514b50965aeeda952f59a64b3d134dc84c1) chore(release): 2.0.7\n#### v2.0.8\n-   [`58e9996`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/58e99961108aaea62b529eb6a16cef785dbe1c80) fix(schema): allow to pass an `{Object}` (&#x60;options.syntax/options.stringifier&#x60;) (#&#8203;300)\n-   [`d39b84e`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/d39b84e95dc128ecb2f3b1dfdc1284088452cf51) docs(README): add `option` types &amp;&amp; links (#&#8203;303)\n-   [`e7e5478`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/e7e547864813a93c06713ca1f8dbf0397766c60a) refactor(lib/Error): remove unused branches (#&#8203;302)\n-   [`df010a7`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/df010a7b13acae2e9abd18690055c713cec4191a) fix(lib/options): handle `{Object}` return (`options.plugins`) (#&#8203;301)\n-   [`bcc9ccf`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/bcc9ccf8b6dbe6143484853da4cac442ecf8aa58) chore(release): 2.0.8\n#### v2.0.9\n-   [`31a25e8`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/31a25e808a5db096e486b4c9fdd0fbab3cc43669) docs(README): fix broken link (`importLoaders`) (#&#8203;310)\n-   [`f33131c`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/f33131c1b48b7817dddd6725c2da713cdb97a42c) test: filter `ident` (`options.ident`) (#&#8203;314)\n-   [`3e1c7fa`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/3e1c7fa3557b36ef33509d846edfab3b970ad47b) fix(index): filter `ident` (`options.ident`) (#&#8203;315)\n-   [`b9c1add`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/b9c1add9a1c5abfebd58006965d278787ce28d4a) chore(release): 2.0.9\n#### v2.0.10\n-   [`61ff03c`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/61ff03c927b37b8c9f2b770c8ca96c39f401e99d) fix(index): copy loader `options` before modifying (#&#8203;326)\n-   [`08c063a`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/08c063ad664853efedbdc3526b10b74d5b45ade0) chore(release): 2.0.10\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
